            <ArticleTitle>Somatoform disorders: before and after DSM-III.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>469-78</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The somatoform disorders were included as a new category of mental disorders in the third edition of the Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders. The authors review the major features of somatization disorder, conversion disorder, psychogenic pain disorder, and hypochondriasis and present a survey of the recent literature about each.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
